[l_english.STATE_LORE_365]
Even as it teetered on the brink of becoming a church to the Windigos, where sacrifices were made and prayers were offered to keep their wrath at bay, the smokestacks of the Weather Factory never ceased to belch out black smoke, like a rusted respirator keeping the remnants of Equestria’s four seasons alive.
Ever since the reign of Cozy Glow, and the disbanding of the Wonderbolts, the Weather Factory had never been able to control the weather again, but their weather forecasts had become more accurate: there were only two types of weather in Equestria now, snowy days that were unsuitable for executions, and snowy days that were suitable for executions.
It wasn’t until the child on the throne pointed at their northern neighbor and started crying and throwing a tantrum that the Meteorological Bureau was established. It was supposed to be a beacon of hope, but it was buried between the red wine glasses of Canterlot bureaucrats, fallen like the workponies of the factory in the snowstorm before the imperial police’s riot shields.
Only those who had lost it knew how precious it was. Only when all the machines in the Weather Factory stopped working did Equestria realize how important it was. And then, whether it was to create thunderstorms at the behest of Rolling Thunder, or to create muffin rain at the behest of Derpy, or to provide heating for the Cloudsdale and Cloudsdale Districts... everyone wanted to restart the Weather Factory for their own purposes, but only the workponies who were still stationed in the factory, unpaid, had the final say.

[l_simp_chinese.STATE_LORE_365]
即使如今已经快要沦为一座向风之魔献祭、祈祷其不要发怒的教堂，天气工厂的烟囱也从未停止过吐出黑烟，像一具生锈的呼吸机般维系着小马利亚残存的四季轮回。
自从和煦光流女皇登基、闪电天马队的解散后，天气工厂就再也没能成功控制过天气，但是他们的天气预报倒是越来越准确了：小马利亚的天气只有两种，不适合行刑的雪天，和适合行刑的雪天。
直到皇位上的小孩子指着北方的邻居又哭又闹的时候，气象局才被设立起来。它原本被寄予厚望，却又被葬送在那些坎特洛特官僚们的红酒杯之间，如同工厂的工马们一般倒在了暴风雪中帝国警察们的防爆盾前。
失去之后才懂得珍惜，当天气工厂的机器全部停止运转后，小马利亚才意识到它的重要。再后来，无论是在滚雷的要求下制造雷暴，抑或是在呆蹄的要求下制造马芬雨，还是为层云堡和云中城地区供暖... 各方都希望将重启的天气工厂收归己用，而只有那些依然无薪驻守在工厂中的工马们才真正说了算。
